### Create wallet
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wallet Principal",
  "limit": "5000.00",
  "cycle_limit_default": "3000.00",
  "cycle_starts": 25,
  "cycle_ends": 9
}

### List wallets
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Wallet detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Update wallet (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wallet Principal Atualizada",
  "limit": "5500.00",
  "cycle_limit_default": "3200.00",
  "cycle_starts": 25,
  "cycle_ends": 10
}

### Update wallet (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wallet Principal Patch",
  "cycle_limit_default": "3100.00"
}

### Delete wallet (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
